    "substantive_mathematical_gap_identified": false,
    "explanation": "The original simp only rewrites cells5/old5/the parent gate inside a sum whose index carrier depends on m, but leaves bindFifth.a, bindFifth.b and bindFifth.m in the source integral. The error is the unresolved representation of unchanged record projections, not a different region or integrand. The held published repair uses the original generic fifthCorrectionIntegral_eq_integrals directly via exact. bindFifth is a transparent record update changing only cells5 and cap5, so its a/b/m/old5 and historical gate are definitionally inherited; the cap5 remains the exact checked selectedBoxCap. No new integral/sign/bound or numerical fifth-certificate fact is supplied."
  },
